\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.10}{\ignorespaces Decrease in Cross-entropy during the fine-tuning phase of the L1 clustering expert, using the Rprop optimizer. This figure shows that the majority of the experts are relatively stagnant, while the a few buckets are responsible for most of the improvement. The analysis shows that some \textit  {lucky} experts get to train on a mix of simpler positions.}}{67}{figure.caption.34}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:expert-finetune-rprop}{{5.10}{67}{Decrease in Cross-entropy during the fine-tuning phase of the L1 clustering expert, using the Rprop optimizer. This figure shows that the majority of the experts are relatively stagnant, while the a few buckets are responsible for most of the improvement. The analysis shows that some \textit {lucky} experts get to train on a mix of simpler positions}{figure.caption.34}{}}
